WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.667
Look at this. Somebody published every prompt they used.

00:00:02.667 --> 00:00:05.333
Paste it in, get the same thing back. Just deploy more agents.

00:00:05.333 --> 00:00:08.000
Why is the wall made of noodles.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Different seed, different render. We can just reason about it.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Then we run it until it works. Twenty more.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Twenty more. Every one of those is a line on a bill.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Afternoon. Just here to settle your twenty three retries.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:22.000
So the prompt was the free part.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.000
A prompt is only worth something if failing is free. Move it onto our own boxes.

